{%- comment -%}
  The brand's three faces (brand board / docs/design-system "Type — the three
  tiers"): DX Burst for the logo (artwork) and print display, Aktiv Grotesk
  Semibold for every website heading and every bit of emphasis, Inter Regular
  for body copy. Rendered by both layouts.

  Aktiv Grotesk is a licensed face, so it can't come from Google Fonts. It
  loads from whichever of these is set in Theme settings → Bush Riding:
    • an Adobe Fonts web project id (family "aktiv-grotesk"), or
    • the URL of a licensed .woff2 uploaded to Content → Files.
  Until one is set, Archivo 600 stands in (the documented substitute).

  inter_only – true on the password page, which needs no Archivo request
               when Aktiv is supplied
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Google Fonts load without holding up the first paint (text shows in the
  fallback, then swaps). Archivo is only fetched while Aktiv isn't set up.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  if settings.alp_font_aktiv != blank or settings.alp_font_kit != blank
    assign gf = 'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400&display=swap'
  else
    assign gf = 'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@600&family=Inter:wght@400&display=swap'
  endif
-%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ gf }}" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ gf }}"></noscript>
{%- if settings.alp_font_kit != blank -%}
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://use.typekit.net/{{ settings.alp_font_kit | strip | escape }}.css">
{%- endif -%}
{%- if settings.alp_font_aktiv != blank -%}
  <link rel="preload" href="{{ settings.alp_font_aktiv | strip }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
  <style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Aktiv Grotesk';
      src: url('{{ settings.alp_font_aktiv | strip }}') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 600;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
    }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
